@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Dynamic semiring: context ownership and bounded value flow

actor "Target-language\ncustomer" as Customer #FCE7F3

rectangle "Host runtime trust boundary" #FFF1F2 {
  component "Semiring implementation\nzero · one · plus · times\nlaws · optional refinements" as Host #FBCFE8
  component "Exception/status\ncontainment trampolines" as Trampoline #FDA4AF
}

rectangle "Stable Vinary Tree ABI" #ECFDF5 {
  component "Retained operation context\nVtResource" as Context #A7F3D0
  component "Base vtable\nvt.semiring.val1" as Base #6EE7B7
  component "Optional vtables\ndiv · star · numeric · properties" as Optional #34D399
  database "Provider-scoped value storage\ninline words or recycling\n(slot, generation) arena" as Arena #99F6E4
  artifact "VtSemiringValue\nword0 · word1" as Token #5EEAD4
}

rectangle "Optimized Rust consumer" #EFF6FF {
  component "Validated dynamic adapter\nthread gate · bounds · ownership" as Adapter #93C5FD
  component "Dynamic WFST / algebra\nalgorithm" as Algorithm #60A5FA
  component "Native monomorphized path\nunchanged, zero ABI calls" as Native #BFDBFE
}

Customer --> Host : 1. implements algebra
Host --> Trampoline : 2. contained callback
Trampoline --> Base : 3. publishes required operations
Trampoline --> Optional : 4. publishes only lawful refinements
Context --> Base : query_interface
Context --> Optional : query_interface
Context --> Arena : owns lifetime
Base --> Token : 5. returns one owned token
Token --> Arena : inline value or (slot, generation)
Adapter --> Context : 6. retain once
Adapter --> Base : 7. validate size/version/flags
Adapter --> Optional : 8. negotiate algorithm requirements
Algorithm --> Adapter : 9. bounded operation batch
Adapter --> Base : 10. call without cache/arena lock
Adapter --> Token : 11. clone/release exactly once
Algorithm ..> Native : specialized built-ins stay here

note bottom of Token
Copying two words is not cloning ownership.
Tokens from distinct contexts never mix,
even when domain_id is equal.
end note

legend right
  |<#FBCFE8>| customer-owned managed code |
  |<#6EE7B7>| stable negotiated ABI |
  |<#93C5FD>| validated dynamic consumer |
  |<#BFDBFE>| unchanged native fast path |
endlegend

@enduml
